# Vercel builds from source; everything below is either a local build artefact
# or an intermediate that is regenerated by `npm run assets`. `.frames` alone is
# ~430MB of per-frame PNGs, and `_material` holds project source and test
# credentials that must never leave this machine.
#
# These are all in .gitignore too — this file states it for the CLI's own
# uploader, which is what a `vercel --prod` from the working tree walks.

.next
.frames
.shots*
_material
node_modules
.claude
# Anchored to the root on purpose: these are the two CV masters that live
# there, and an unanchored `Kevin_Wu_CV.pdf` would also match the copy under
# public/cv/ — which is the file the download route serves.
/CV.pdf
/Kevin_Wu_CV.pdf
